        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About this game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Recyclamation </i>was lovingly crafted in ten weeks by a small team as part of Threeclipse's Junior Program — an initiative created for recent graduates and individuals wanting to pivot into the gaming industry. It's the first project &amp; portfolio piece for most of the cohort's developers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180390/extras/d67f3f546eeb6cdf870179d6ed9b2886.poster.avif?t=1766013564\" width=1170 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180390/extras/d67f3f546eeb6cdf870179d6ed9b2886.webm?t=1766013564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Obey and recycle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Unit 481202, a mindwiped drone put to work in a reclamation facility.  You must identify recyclable items by sight or with devices and place them in the correct chutes.  You must keep the various stores above a critical level, lest you be sent back for further “retraining”.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180390/extras/d67f3f546eeb6cdf870179d6ed9b2886.poster.avif?t=1766013564\" width=1170 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180390/extras/d67f3f546eeb6cdf870179d6ed9b2886.webm?t=1766013564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reclaim your memories</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you perform your task, some items you find trigger suppressed memories.  You begin to recall who you are, where you are, and what lies beyond the facility’s walls. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180390/extras/d67f3f546eeb6cdf870179d6ed9b2886.poster.avif?t=1766013564\" width=1170 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180390/extras/d67f3f546eeb6cdf870179d6ed9b2886.webm?t=1766013564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A friend’s cause</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strange creature claiming to be a friend from your past asks you to secretly acquire specific items to aid in their cause.  It’s up to you whether or not to help... but if you do, don’t get caught by the Supervisor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180390/extras/d67f3f546eeb6cdf870179d6ed9b2886.poster.avif?t=1766013564\" width=1170 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180390/extras/d67f3f546eeb6cdf870179d6ed9b2886.webm?t=1766013564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About this game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Recyclamation </i>was lovingly crafted in ten weeks by a small team as part of Threeclipse's Junior Program — an initiative created for recent graduates and individuals wanting to pivot into the gaming industry. It's the first project &amp; portfolio piece for most of the cohort's developers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180390/extras/d67f3f546eeb6cdf870179d6ed9b2886.poster.avif?t=1766013564\" width=1170 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180390/extras/d67f3f546eeb6cdf870179d6ed9b2886.webm?t=1766013564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Obey and recycle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Unit 481202, a mindwiped drone put to work in a reclamation facility.  You must identify recyclable items by sight or with devices and place them in the correct chutes.  You must keep the various stores above a critical level, lest you be sent back for further “retraining”.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180390/extras/d67f3f546eeb6cdf870179d6ed9b2886.poster.avif?t=1766013564\" width=1170 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180390/extras/d67f3f546eeb6cdf870179d6ed9b2886.webm?t=1766013564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reclaim your memories</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you perform your task, some items you find trigger suppressed memories.  You begin to recall who you are, where you are, and what lies beyond the facility’s walls. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180390/extras/d67f3f546eeb6cdf870179d6ed9b2886.poster.avif?t=1766013564\" width=1170 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180390/extras/d67f3f546eeb6cdf870179d6ed9b2886.webm?t=1766013564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A friend’s cause</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strange creature claiming to be a friend from your past asks you to secretly acquire specific items to aid in their cause.  It’s up to you whether or not to help... but if you do, don’t get caught by the Supervisor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180390/extras/d67f3f546eeb6cdf870179d6ed9b2886.poster.avif?t=1766013564\" width=1170 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4180390/extras/d67f3f546eeb6cdf870179d6ed9b2886.webm?t=1766013564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
        "short_description": "Recyclamation is a gritty sci-fi job simulator. The victim of a mind-wiping process, you sort trash as you regain your lost memories and uncover the truth of who you are and the world around you. Will you learn who you were and how you came here, or will you continue your life as a mindless drone?",
